OL,3,GNEWSAWool campaigner to wear same dress
OL,4,Afor 90 days
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs fast fashion makes clothes
OL,7,Fincreasingly disposable, one woman is
OL,8,Fundertaking a challenge to wear the
OL,9,Fsame dress every day for 90 days.
OL,11,FSarah Turner said she was doing it as
OL,12,Fpart of a campaign against
OL,13,Fmass-produced garments and to
OL,14,F"champion" British wool.
OL,16,FThe average person discards 192 items
OL,17,Fof clothing a year ` equivalent to
OL,18,Faround 16 items every month, according
OL,19,Fto British Wool, a rise of 65% since
OL,20,F2023.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
